WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
Dazhe

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,120
First, give Mr. Ma Fu a good beating.

3
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,240
To relieve my second uncle's anger

4
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:06,760
Let me see who dares

5
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:20,040
This mahu

6
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,820
This is what the Bull Demon King is like, right?

7
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:26,190
My son's second uncle

8
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,430
Next time you fight, don't punch someone in the head.

9
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:29,790
What if it turns into a vegetative state?

10
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:32,510
You have to take responsibility, it's okay, I have a sense of propriety

11
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:34,030
I didn’t hit the back of my head just now

12
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:46,050
Baozi had to interrupt him to beat him today.

13
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:47,570
I'm the director's father

14
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,050
If you don't tell me, you will retire immediately.

15
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,090
Why don't you put your name on it now?

16
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:55,610
Traditionally, it’s not you who has the final say

17
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,330
Uncle is more powerful than dad

18
00:00:57,490 --> 00:01:01,190
They are indeed brothers.

19
00:01:01,630 --> 00:01:02,550
That's it

20
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:04,310
Let's go to my place for a drink today at noon

21
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:10,040
An'an and Chunli have gone home anyway, so you go ahead. It's taken you so long.

22
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,120
I have to go back first

23
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:21,300
Go ahead and sell the leather carvings so they don't stink. Tell your mother what you think.

24
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,900
Dalei and I live well

25
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:26,140
But this is all because of his father and he doesn't feel sorry for An An

26
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:29,160
I won't take my children back or let Dalei separate the family.

27
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,120
Stay away from the old man

28
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,800
Isn't his father the one who loves Ueko the most?

29
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:32,920
Then let Ueko take care of him in his old age

30
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The land allocated to them was also given to them for cultivation.

31
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,200
The three of you rent out the land and find another place to live. If Dalei is so filial, he may not agree to leave if he disagrees.

32
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,600
Our family doesn’t lack food for you and An An.

33
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:47,460
Mom will never let you be wronged again. An'an, don't be afraid.

34
00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:48,380
My uncle is here

35
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:50,420
No one can bully you Huzi

36
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:52,020
Your skills are getting better and better

37
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:53,260
Not a single bullet hole

38
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:55,700
It would be better to use it to make a carved leather coat than Uncle Fan.

39
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:57,140
It takes twelve carved skins to make one coat

40
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:58,860
Those who can afford it are either those who sign for high officials or those who do business.

41
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:03,300
Let's make some hard-earned money, two hundred dollars a cent.
